'''Mesmer [[Krytan armor]]''' is an art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign as [[Mesmer collector armor|collector armor]] and is also available in the Factions campaign.

'''Note''': Mesmer Krytan armor art does not have headgear, but the [[Mesmer Costume Mask]] are available from the same armorer in Factions. Pictures and crafting details are available on that page. In Prophecies, the [[Mesmer Animal Mask|Animal]], [[Mesmer Imposing Mask|Imposing]] and [[Mesmer Sleek Mask|Sleek]] masks are also available, from [[Mesmer collector armor|collectors]].

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Krytan armor.

